    "name_raw": "Electric Eel Style",
    "definition_type_raw": "Combat, Style",
    "source_book_raw": "Blood of the Sea pg. 11",
    "definition_raw": "Source Blood of the Sea pg. 11\nYou have learned how to harness electrical energy to momentarily disorient your foes.\n\nPrerequisites: Wis 13, Elemental FistAPG, Improved Unarmed Strike, base attack bonus +9 or monk level 5th.\n\nBenefit: You gain one additional Elemental Fist (Advanced Player’s Guide 158) attempt per day. While you are in this style, your Elemental Fist attack deals electricity damage. When a creature takes electricity damage from your Elemental Fist attack, you gain a +4 bonus for 1 round on combat maneuver checks to grapple the creature.",
